#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:11
msgid "KDE Partition Manager"
msgstr "Xestor de particiones de KDE"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:12
msgid "Manage disk devices, partitions and file systems on your computer"
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:14
msgid ""
"KDE Partition Manager is a utility program to help you manage the disk "
"devices, partitions and file systems on your computer. It allows you to "
"easily create, copy, move, delete, resize without losing data, backup and "
"restore partitions."
msgstr ""
"El xestor de particiones de KDE ye una utilidá p'ayudate a xestionar los "
"preseos d'almacenamientu, particiones y sistemes de ficheros del ordenador. "
"Permítete crear, copiar, mover, desaniciar, redimensionar ensin perder "
"datos, facer copies de seguranza y restaurar particiones fácilmente"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:15
msgid "Features:"
msgstr "Carauterístiques:"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:17
msgid ""
"Supports a large number of file systems, including ext2/3/4, btrfs, "
"reiserfs, NTFS, FAT16/32, JFS, XFS and more"
msgstr ""
"Sofita un númberu grande de sistemes de ficheros, incluyendo ext2/3/4, "
"btrfs, reiserfs, NTFS, FAT16/32, JFS, XFS y más"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.partitionmanager.appdata.xml:18
msgid "Makes use of already available external programs to get its job done"
msgstr ""
"Fai usu de programes esternos que yá tean disponibles pa facer el trabayu"

#~ msgid "Partition Editor"
#~ msgstr "Editor de particiones"
